Laboratories of Democratic Renewal Replication\
\
The R Script \'93laboratories-of-democratic-renewal-replication-final.R\'94 contains all the code needed to replicate the tables and figures in the text and SI. \
\
The R Script uses the various datasets contained in the Replication Materials folder. \
\
The researcher will need to set their directory to the Replication Materials folder before executing code in order to make the code run correctly. \
\
A log file of the R script is contained in the Log folder. \
\
Technical Specifications for Replication: \
\
All analyses were run on a MacBook Pro, on macOS Sequoia 15.4. 16 GB RAM. \
